## Quick Checklist

Before submitting code:

**Performance:**
- [ ] Icons use `MemoIcon*` variants
- [ ] Event handlers wrapped in `useCallback`
- [ ] Heavy components wrapped in `memo()`
- [ ] Expensive computations use `useMemo`
- [ ] Constants defined outside components
- [ ] No inline objects/arrays as props

**Hooks:**
- [ ] All dependencies listed in useEffect/useCallback/useMemo
- [ ] Using `useRefFor` for stable callbacks needing current values
- [ ] i18n depends on `i18n.language`, not `t`

**State:**
- [ ] Not duplicating props into state
- [ ] Using Redux for deeply shared state
- [ ] API calls not duplicated across components

**Code Quality:**
- [ ] Null/undefined guards in place
- [ ] Enums imported from submodules
- [ ] Using existing types and components
- [ ] Generic types only when type can't be inferred from initial value
- [ ] Boolean props omit `={true}` and omit prop when `false`
- [ ] Tooltip uses `cursor-auto` for non-clickable elements
- [ ] No console.log statements
- [ ] I/O operations have error handling
- [ ] Array types use `T[]` syntax
